<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Asta Chamma (Chinnata | 5 Houses) — Interactive Royal Edition</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.17"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --khadi-bg: #f4efe6;
      --khadi-card: #ebe3d5;
      --indigo-ink: #172554;
      --indigo-line: #1e3a8a;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background-color: #1c1917;
      color: #f5f5f4;
      margin: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    .font-heritage {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    }
    /* Khadi Woven Fabric Texture */
    .khadi-mat {
      background-color: #f3eee4;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(120, 95, 65, 0.045) 0px, rgba(120, 95, 65, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 4px),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120, 95, 65, 0.045) 0px, rgba(120, 95, 65, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.45), rgba(214,199,178,0.35));
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), inset 0 0 32px rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.22);
    }
    .vertical-text-left {
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }
    .vertical-text-right {
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    }
    @keyframes shellToss {
      0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg) scale(1); }
      35% { transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(160deg) scale(1.14); }
      70% { transform: translateY(4px) rotate(310deg) scale(0.96); }
      100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(360deg) scale(1); }
    }
    .shell-anim {
      animation: shellToss 0.48s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    @keyframes pulseRing {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.12); opacity: 0.45; }
    }
    .pawn-selectable {
      animation: pulseRing 1.3s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 3px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-stone-950 text-stone-100 flex flex-col">

  <!-- Top Header & Navigation -->
  <header class="border-b border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/90 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-30">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 py-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-400/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-300 font-heritage font-bold text-lg shadow-inner">
          ☸
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h1 class="font-heritage font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-wide text-amber-100">
              ASTA CHAMMA <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal text-amber-400/90">(Chinnata | 5 Houses)</span>
            </h1>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 hidden sm:block">
            Chauka Bara • Katte Mane • Daayam • Champool • Chomal Ishto • Changa Po
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- View Switcher & Audio/New Game Controls -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
        <div class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-stone-800 p-0.5 border border-stone-700">
          <button id="tabBtnPlay" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500 text-stone-950 transition">
            Play Board
          </button>
          <button id="tabBtnAnalysis" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold text-stone-300 hover:text-white transition">
            Path &amp; Odds
          </button>
          <button id="tabBtnRules" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold text-stone-300 hover:text-white transition">
            Complete Rules
          </button>
        </div>

        <button id="btnOpenSettings" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 border border-stone-700 text-xs font-medium text-stone-200 flex items-center gap-1 transition" title="Rule Variations & Match Setup">
          <span>⚙️</span> <span class="hidden md:inline">Setup</span>
        </button>

        <button id="btnToggleSound" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 border border-stone-700 text-xs font-medium text-stone-200 transition" title="Toggle Sound Effects">
          🔊
        </button>

        <button id="btnNewMatch" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold transition shadow">
          ↻ Reset
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Workspace -->
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-2 sm:px-6 py-4">

    <!-- VIEW 1: PLAYABLE GAME BOARD -->
    <section id="viewPlay" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-start">

      <!-- Left Column: The Authentic Khadi Canvas 5x5 Board (7 cols on lg) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[580px] khadi-mat rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-5 border-2 border-stone-400/60 relative select-none">

          <!-- Top Cultural Header on Canvas -->
          <div class="text-center mb-1.5">
            <h2 class="font-heritage font-extrabold text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-xl tracking-tight">
              Asta Chamma <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-900">(Chinnata | 5 Houses)</span>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <!-- Middle Row: Left Border Text + Interactive SVG/Canvas Board + Right Border Text -->
          <div class="flex items-stretch justify-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
            <!-- Left Vertical Regional Names -->
            <div class="vertical-text-left text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-indigo-950/90 flex items-center justify-center py-2">
              Daayam / Thaayam | Chauka Bara / Katte Mane
            </div>

            <!-- Interactive 5x5 Board Container -->
            <div class="relative flex-1 aspect-square max-w-[490px] w-full">
              <canvas id="boardCanvas" width="600" height="600" class="w-full h-full rounded-sm cursor-pointer block"></canvas>

              <!-- Floating Route Overlay Legend Badge -->
              <div id="boardHoverTooltip" class="hidden absolute top-2 left-2 bg-stone-900/90 text-amber-100 text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-400/40 pointer-events-none shadow-lg">
                Square (0,0)
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Vertical Regional Names -->
            <div class="vertical-text-right text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-indigo-950/90 flex items-center justify-center py-2">
              Champool | Chomal Ishto / Kaangi chaala | Changa po
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Cultural Footer on Canvas -->
          <div class="mt-2 pt-1 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-indigo-950/90 px-2 sm:px-5">
            <span class="tracking-wide">☸ Traditional 5×5 Spiral Grid</span>
            <span class="text-indigo-900/80">Outer: Counter-Clockwise ↺ • Inner: Clockwise ↻</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Visual Legend & Path Inspector Bar under Board -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-[580px] mt-3 bg-stone-900/90 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
            <span class="text-stone-400 font-medium">Show Spiral Path:</span>
            <button data-path-player="-1" class="path-preview-btn px-2 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500 text-stone-950 font-semibold transition">Active Turn</button>
            <button data-path-player="0" class="path-preview-btn px-2 py-1 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-orange-300 transition">🟠 Orange (S)</button>
            <button data-path-player="1" class="path-preview-btn px-2 py-1 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-teal-300 transition">🟢 Teal (E)</button>
            <button data-path-player="2" class="path-preview-btn px-2 py-1 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-blue-300 transition">🔵 Blue (N)</button>
            <button data-path-player="3" class="path-preview-btn px-2 py-1 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-purple-300 transition">🟣 Purple (W)</button>
          </div>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-300 cursor-pointer">
            <input type="checkbox" id="chkShowCoords" class="rounded bg-stone-800 border-stone-600 text-amber-500" />
            <span>Step Numbers</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Cowrie Shell Thrower, Roll Pool, Player Houses & Move Log (5 cols on lg) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-3.5">

        <!-- Active Turn & Cowrie Shell Tray Card -->
        <div class="bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span id="turnColorDot" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-orange-500 ring-4 ring-orange-500/20"></span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 font-semibold">Current Turn</div>
                <div id="turnPlayerTitle" class="text-base font-bold text-white">South House (Orange)</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="turnStatusPill" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30">
              Throw Cowries
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4 Cowrie Shells Visual Tray -->
          <div class="bg-stone-950/90 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 mb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-stone-400">4 Cowrie Shells (<span class="italic text-stone-300">Gavvalu / Kavade</span>)</span>
              <span id="lastRollCallout" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300">Ready to Cast</span>
            </div>

            <!-- The 4 Shells -->
            <div id="cowrieContainer" class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 my-2">
              <!-- Populated by JS -->
            </div>

            <!-- Action Buttons: Throw Cowries + Pair Mode Toggle -->
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <button id="btnThrowCowries" class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-400 text-stone-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                <span>🐚</span> <span id="btnThrowLabel">Throw Cowrie Shells</span>
              </button>

              <button id="btnTogglePairMove" class="px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 border border-stone-700 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-300 transition flex items-center gap-1.5" title="When two of your pawns share a square, toggle moving them together as a Double (Jodi/Gatti) vs moving a single pawn">
                <span>🔗</span> <span id="pairModeLabel">Move: Single</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Active Roll Pool (Supports Chamma 4 & Ashta 8 Multi-Roll Chains) -->
          <div class="bg-stone-950/60 border border-stone-800/80 rounded-xl p-3">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-300">Active Roll Pool (Click a value, then click a pawn)</span>
              <span id="rollPoolHint" class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">0 pending</span>
            </div>
            <div id="rollPoolContainer" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 min-h-[34px] items-center">
              <span class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic">Cast the shells to generate move steps...</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Optional Sandbox Test Roll Bar (for testing specific traditional rules immediately) -->
            <div class="mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-stone-800/80 flex items-center justify-between gap-1 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">Test Cast:</span>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                <button data-force-roll="1" class="force-roll-btn px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-[11px] text-stone-300 border border-stone-700">1 (Dayam)</button>
                <button data-force-roll="2" class="force-roll-btn px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-[11px] text-stone-300 border border-stone-700">2 (Duga)</button>
                <button data-force-roll="3" class="force-roll-btn px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-[11px] text-stone-300 border border-stone-700">3 (Thiga)</button>
                <button data-force-roll="4" class="force-roll-btn px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-950/80 hover:bg-amber-900 text-[11px] text-amber-300 border border-amber-700/50">4 (Chamma+)</button>
                <button data-force-roll="8" class="force-roll-btn px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-950/80 hover:bg-amber-900 text-[11px] text-amber-300 border border-amber-700/50">8 (Ashta+)</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Houses Status Cards (Shows Pawns Home, Inner Gate Lock/Unlock, Captures) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5" id="playerCardsGrid">
          <!-- Populated dynamically by JS -->
        </div>

        <!-- Live Commentary & Move History Log -->
        <div class="bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-3.5 flex-1 flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400">Chronicle of Moves</h3>
            <span id="ruleActiveSummary" class="text-[11px] text-amber-400/90">Blood-Gate: ON • Doubles: ON</span>
          </div>
          <div id="moveLogList" class="space-y-1.5 max-h-44 overflow-y-auto pr-1 text-xs">
            <!-- Populated by JS -->
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VIEW 2: PATH GEOMETRY & MATHEMATICAL ODDS ANALYZER -->
    <section id="viewAnalysis" class="hidden space-y-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5">
        <!-- Cowrie Shell Binomial Probability Breakdown -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h2 class="font-heritage text-lg font-bold text-amber-200 mb-1">
1. Mathematical Analysis of the 4 Cowrie Shells
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mb-4">
            Unlike a uniform 6-sided cubic die, 4 cowrie shells (<span class="italic">Cypraea moneta</span>) produce a non-uniform binomial distribution across <span class="text-stone-200 font-semibold">2⁴ = 16</span> binary configurations (assuming balanced probability <span class="font-mono">p = 0.5</span> per shell landing mouth-up):
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-stone-700 text-stone-400">
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Mouths Up</th>
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Traditional Name</th>
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Steps</th>
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Combinations</th>
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Exact Odds</th>
                  <th class="py-2 px-2">Extra Turn?</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-800 text-stone-200">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">1 Up, 3 Down</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-stone-100">Okkati / Dayam / Ekka</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-bold text-amber-300">1 step</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">C(4,1) = 4/16</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono text-emerald-400">25.00%</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-stone-400">No</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">2 Up, 2 Down</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-stone-100">Rendu / Duga / Bara-Two</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-bold text-amber-300">2 steps</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">C(4,2) = 6/16</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono text-emerald-400">37.50%</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-stone-400">No</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">3 Up, 1 Down</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-stone-100">Moodu / Thiga / Three</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-bold text-amber-300">3 steps</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">C(4,3) = 4/16</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono text-emerald-400">25.00%</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 text-stone-400">No</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-amber-500/5">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">4 Up, 0 Down</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-amber-300">Chamma / Chauka</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-bold text-amber-300">4 steps</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">C(4,4) = 1/16</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono text-amber-300">6.25%</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-amber-300">Yes (+Roll)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-amber-500/5">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">0 Up, 4 Down</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-amber-300">Ashta / Bara</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-bold text-amber-300">8 steps</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono">C(4,0) = 1/16</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-mono text-amber-300">6.25%</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-2 font-semibold text-amber-300">Yes (+Roll)</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-center">
            <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">Single Throw EV</div>
              <div class="text-base font-bold text-amber-300">2.50 steps</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">(4×1 + 6×2 + 4×3 + 1×4 + 1×8)/16</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">Bonus Chain Chance</div>
              <div class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-400">12.50%</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">1 in 8 throws grants bonus</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">Full Turn EV (w/ Bonus)</div>
              <div class="text-base font-bold text-amber-300">2.857 steps</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">2.50 / (1 − 0.125) = 20/7</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Topological Board Structure & 25-Step Journey -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <h2 class="font-heritage text-lg font-bold text-amber-200 mb-1">
2. Topological Structure of the 5×5 Board (Chinnata)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mb-3">
            Every pawn must traverse exactly <span class="text-stone-100 font-semibold">24 steps (25 cells)</span> from its outer crossed Home square (<span class="font-mono">Step 0</span>) to the central Ashoka Chakra sanctuary (<span class="font-mono">Step 24</span>):
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800">
              <div class="font-bold text-amber-300 mb-0.5">Phase A — Outer Perimeter Ring (Steps 0 → 15, Counter-Clockwise ↺)</div>
              <p class="text-stone-300">
                Pawns start on their side's middle crossed safe house (<span class="font-mono">Step 0</span>) and race anti-clockwise around the 16 exterior squares. Every 4 steps (<span class="font-mono">Steps 0, 4, 8, 12</span>) is an <span class="font-semibold text-white">X-marked Safe House</span>—meaning a Chamma (4) or Ashta (8) from any outer safe house lands directly on another safe house!
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800">
              <div class="font-bold text-rose-400 mb-0.5">Phase B — The Blood Gate at Step 15 (Hit-to-Enter Qualification)</div>
              <p class="text-stone-300">
                <span class="font-mono">Step 15</span> is the square immediately to the left of a player's starting house. A player's pawns can only turn inward from <span class="font-mono">Step 15 → Step 16</span> if that player has <span class="font-semibold text-white">captured ("cut") at least one enemy pawn</span> during the game. Until unlocked, pawns reaching <span class="font-mono">Step 15</span> continue orbiting the outer 16-square loop.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800">
              <div class="font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-0.5">Phase C — Inner 3×3 Ring (Steps 16 → 23, Clockwise ↻) &amp; Exact Finish (Step 24)</div>
              <p class="text-stone-300">
                Upon entering <span class="font-mono">Step 16</span>, the direction reverses to <span class="font-semibold text-white">clockwise</span> around the 8 squares of the inner 3×3 ring. Because there are no safe houses on the inner ring, pawns inside are vulnerable to enemy hunters behind them unless paired as a <span class="font-semibold text-white">Double (Gatti)</span>. From <span class="font-mono">Step 23</span>, an exact roll steps into <span class="font-mono">Step 24 (Center Chakra)</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VIEW 3: COMPLETE TRADITIONAL RULES & REGIONAL HERITAGE -->
    <section id="viewRules" class="hidden space-y-5">
      <div class="bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-5">
        <h2 class="font-heritage text-xl font-bold text-amber-200 mb-2">
          Complete Rules &amp; Regional Heritage codified in this Game
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 mb-4">
          The board in your photo is the classic 5×5 <span class="font-semibold text-amber-300">Asta Chamma (Chinnata | 5 Houses)</span> cloth mat by Bharataha!, featuring natural tumbled stone pawns (Orange, Turquoise, Blue, Purple) and 4 white cowrie shells. All regional rules printed along its borders are built into this simulator:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-sm mb-1.5">1. Casting &amp; Bonus Chains</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
              Throw 4 cowrie shells. Count mouths facing up: <span class="text-white font-semibold">1, 2, or 3</span> ends your throwing phase. All 4 mouths up is <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">Chamma / Chauka (4)</span>; all 4 mouths down (inverted) is <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">Ashta / Bara (8)</span>. Both 4 and 8 add to your Roll Pool and grant an immediate bonus throw. You may split accumulated rolls across multiple pawns or combine them on a single runner.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-sm mb-1.5">2. Safe Houses (Ghatta / Chira)</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
              The 4 outer crossed squares <span class="font-mono">(0,2), (2,0), (4,2), (2,4)</span> and the central Ashoka Chakra <span class="font-mono">(2,2)</span> are <span class="text-white font-semibold">Safe Houses</span>. Pawns resting on an X-marked square cannot be captured, and pawns of all 4 players may occupy them simultaneously.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-sm mb-1.5">3. Cutting (Champa) &amp; Blood Gate</h3>
