              Landing on an opponent's single pawn on an uncrossed square <span class="text-white font-semibold">cuts (captures)</span> it, returning it to its starting Home square (<span class="font-mono">Step 0</span>) and awarding you a <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">bonus throw</span>. A player must score at least <span class="text-white font-semibold">one cut</span> before any of their 4 pawns are allowed to enter the inner 3×3 clockwise loop.
