              Known in Karnataka as <span class="italic text-white">Moor Naak Shyam / Moor Ent Shyam</span>: if a player casts Chamma (4) or Ashta (8) <span class="text-white font-semibold">three times consecutively</span> in a single turn, the streak is considered over-blessed and busts (can be toggled on/off in Setup).
            </p>
