            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-sm mb-1.5">6. Exact Entry to Center Home</h3>
            <p class="text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
              To reach the central Ashoka Chakra (<span class="font-mono">Step 24</span>), you must roll the <span class="text-white font-semibold">exact number of remaining steps</span>. Note that entering the inner loop at <span class="font-mono">Step 16</span> places a pawn exactly <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold">8 steps</span> from the center—so an <span class="font-semibold">Ashta (8)</span> from <span class="font-mono">Step 16</span> scores an instant home run!
